From the Oxygen sound theme (https://invent.kde.org/plasma/oxygen-sounds),
sounds/oxygen/stereo/outcome-success.ogg, which the theme also installs as
power-plug.ogg. Decoded unmodified to 16-bit 48 kHz stereo WAV because Qt's
SoundEffect only plays uncompressed audio. The license text is in
LGPL-3.0-or-later.txt next to this file.
